# The extrusion of path_extrude mirrored in the face clicked, the mirror
# set on its screen to reflect the whole solid so far; the same as
# path_mirror_solid.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/mirror_solid).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
menu Features|Mirror
twmove 60 165
twdown L 60 165
twup L 60 165
